0 Ripple Relay — universal-joint cancellation
0 Name: ripple-relay.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/ripple-relay.txt
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub, one medium angular motor on A; no world-fixed fixture.
0 // Joint centers (0,-100,0) and (160,-100,120); equal 36.86989765 degree bends.
0 // Middle-shaft forks are parallel. Yellow=input, red=middle, blue=output.
0 // Native CAD: omits exactly two 62519 meshes; stock solver infers their cross bodies.
0 // Flexible cable and installed hub battery are not separately modeled. See BUILD.md.
0 // Stage 1: Braced base, lapped rails and level feet
